{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2021-11-10 13:05:00', 'title': 'SOCALGAS PARTNERS WITH PEOPLE ASSISTING THE HOMELESS (PATH) AND LA FAMILY HOUSING ON PROJECT HOMEKEY INITIATIVE', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, NOV. 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA GAS CO. (SOCALGAS) PARTNERS WITHPEOPLE ASSISTING THE HOMELESS (PATH) AND LA FAMILY HOUSING (LAFH) IN A CONTINUOUS EFFORT TO SUPPORT PROJECT HOMEKEY, A STATEWIDE EFFORT BETWEEN LOS ANGELES COUNTY AND THE STATE OF CALIFORNIA TO RELOCATE UNHOUSED INDIVIDUALS INTO PERMANENT HOUSING. THE UTILITY HAS PROVIDED OVER $300,000 IN ASSISTANCE TOWARDS ENERGY EFFICIENCY PROGRAMS AND EQUIPMENT INSTALLATION IN OVER 650 PROJECT HOMEKEY UNITS.'}